# `pipeline.step_done`

Agent declares the current pipeline step complete.

**Policy** — command `[C1_WORKSPACE]`. Capability `ship.runtime.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type | required |
|------|------|----------|
| `slug` | `string` | yes |
| `summary` | `string?` | no |
| `outputs` | `map` | no |

## Returns

